    "answer": {
      "short": "$150\\pi\\text{ cm}^2\\approx471.24\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}S&=2\\pi r^2+2\\pi rh\\\\S&=2\\pi(5)^2+2\\pi(5)(10)\\\\S&=150\\pi\\text{ cm}^2\\\\S&\\approx471.24\\text{ cm}^2.\\end{aligned}$$",
